      "ownership": "Ordinary Homebrew casks/formula only. Preexisting installations are preserved, foreign destinations/payload replacements refused, non-zap retirement leaves all preferences, credentials and app data untouched.",
      "version_policy": "Package versions and SHA-256 snapshots record the reviewed provider release, not an immutable Homebrew tap pin. Explicit provision resolves current native Homebrew metadata; updates reports upstream, provider and actual installed separately. Generic recover refuses Homebrew rollback without a retained exact bottle; explicit provision can reinstall a reviewed current provider release, but removed historical casks/bottles are not promised recoverable.",
